# Search Request

## Normal Search

```bash
/api/products/?search=iphone
```

---

## Multiple Word Search

```bash
/api/products/?search=apple mobile
```

---

## Search + Ordering

```bash
/api/products/?search=iphone&ordering=-price
```

---

# Search Operators

## Contains Search

```python
search_fields = ['title']
```

---

## Exact Search

```python
search_fields = ['=title']
```

---

## Starts With Search

```python
search_fields = ['^title']
```

---

## Regex Search

```python
search_fields = ['$title']
```

---

## Full Text Search (Postgres)

```python
search_fields = ['@title']
```

