# Important Points

## SearchFilter

```python
filter_backends = [SearchFilter]
```

Search enable karta hai.

---

## search_fields

```python
search_fields = ['title']
```

Batata hai search kin fields me chalega.

---

## Foreign Key Search

```python
search_fields = ['category__name']
```

Related model field me search.

